421	     * Build a PII-safe shopify_data snapshot for storage.
422	     * Full PII paths are redacted by RedactCustomerJob; here we exclude the
423	     * top-level customer object and billing/shipping addresses (contain name/email/phone).
424	     * Non-PII structural fields (financial_status, name, currency, etc.) are preserved
